say Hello, welcome to the manhunt game!
say Some players will be the runners and the others will be hunters.
say The runners' goal is to survive and kill the dragon.
say The hunters' goal is to kill the runners.
say -----------------------------------------------------
say Here are some commands to help you start the game:
say /trigger start - to start the game
say /team join hunter - to join the hunters' team
say /team join runner - to join the runners' team